.TH loom-action 1  "loom-action " 
.SH NAME
loom\-action \- Action invocation (RPC)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBloom\-action\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-session\fR> <\fIMETHOD\fR> [\fIEXTRA\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Action invocation (RPC)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR \fI<SESSION>\fR
`\-\-session SID` is required by all action methods
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIMETHOD\fR>
`<surface>.<verb>` (e.g. `web.click`)
.TP
[\fIEXTRA\fR]
Remaining `\-\-key value` pairs gathered as raw strings; validated against the JSON\-Schema for `method` before RPC dispatch
.SH SUPPORTED ACTIONS
.PP
Loom ships with the following registered actions. Run \fBloom action <name> --help\fR for the full per-action signature.
.SS \fBweb.*\fR
.TP
\fBweb.clear_cookies\fR
Clear ALL cookies in the browser's cookie jar (CDP `Network.clearBrowserCookies`).
.TP
\fBweb.click\fR
Click an element by CSS selector or a text=/role=/frame= locator.
.TP
\fBweb.delete_cookies\fR
Delete a single cookie scoped by (name, url?, domain?, path?) — CDP `Network.deleteCookies`.
.TP
\fBweb.evaluate\fR
Run a JavaScript expression in the page and return the value.
.TP
\fBweb.get_cookies\fR
Read cookies from the browser's cookie jar (CDP `Network.getCookies`).
.TP
\fBweb.hover\fR
Dispatch a mouseover event at an element (CSS or a text=/role=/frame= locator).
.TP
\fBweb.inject_audio\fR
Inject caller-provided audio into the page's virtual microphone.
.TP
\fBweb.navigate\fR
Load a URL, follow redirects, capture DOM and screenshot.
.TP
\fBweb.network_log\fR
Read the per-request network entries observed since the last navigate.
.TP
\fBweb.press_key\fR
Dispatch a real key press (Enter, Tab, …) via CDP Input.dispatchKeyEvent.
.TP
\fBweb.say\fR
Speak text into the page's microphone via a configured external TTS backend.
.TP
\fBweb.screenshot\fR
Capture a PNG screenshot of the page or a selected element.
.TP
\fBweb.scroll\fR
Scroll the page (or an element) by a (delta_x, delta_y) offset.
.TP
\fBweb.select\fR
Set the value of a `<select>` element and dispatch `change`.
.TP
\fBweb.set_cookies\fR
Inject cookies into the browser's network stack via CDP `Network.setCookies`.
.TP
\fBweb.set_input_files\fR
Upload local files into an <input type=file> by CSS (or a css=/frame= locator).
.TP
\fBweb.snapshot\fR
Capture a full DOM snapshot of the active page.
.TP
\fBweb.start_audio_capture\fR
Begin capturing inbound call audio into a bounded in-page buffer.
.TP
\fBweb.start_recording\fR
Start recording a video (screencast) of the page.
.TP
\fBweb.stop_audio_capture\fR
Stop inbound audio capture; return the buffered audio as a WAV reference.
.TP
\fBweb.stop_recording\fR
Stop the active video recording and return its content hash.
.TP
\fBweb.type\fR
Focus an input (by CSS or a text=/role=/frame= locator) and type text into it.
.TP
\fBweb.wait\fR
Wait until a locator resolves (or until timeout).
.TP
\fBweb.wait_for\fR
Wait until the current page reaches a readiness state (settle-capture).
